# Emergency stop request -> control (server: /emergency_stop on control node).
# Caller: DB (UI E-STOP button), or terminal for testing:
#   ros2 service call /emergency_stop box_interfaces/srv/EmergencyStop "{source: 'cli'}"
# Control stops the robot (Doosan move_stop), cancels the running part goal,
# and records STOPPED : EMERGENCY STOP. Works before start too (start is canceled).
string source          # who pressed it: "ui" / "cli" / ...
---
bool success
string message
